{"book":"romans","num":16,"verses":[{"en":"I commend unto you Phebe our sister, which is a servant of the church which is at Cenchrea:","n":1,"sm":"Atua 1 Ou te faailoa atu ia te outou lo tatou tuafafine o Fipe, o le tiakono lea o le ekalesia o i Kenikerea;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"","sm":"1"},{"en":"","sm":"Ou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"faailoa"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"lo"},{"en":"","sm":"tatou"},{"en":"","sm":"tuafafine"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Fipe,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tiakono"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ekalesia"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"Kenikerea;"}]},{"en":"That ye receive her in the Lord, as becometh saints, and that ye assist her in whatsoever business she hath need of you: for she hath been a succourer of many, and of myself also.","n":2,"sm":"ina ia talia o ia e outou ile Alii, faapei ona tatau i le au paia, ia outou fesoasoani foi ia te ia i se mea a outou e aoga ia te ia; aua foi e toatele ua ia fesoasoani i ai, atoa ma aʻu nei.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"talia"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"ile"},{"en":"","sm":"Alii,"},{"en":"","sm":"faapei"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"tatau"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"paia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"fesoasoani"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"aoga"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia;"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"toatele"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ia